WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.490 line:88%
Hello, I'm Haoqi Luo, a senior at UW Foster,

2
00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:07.791 line:88%
studying Information Systems and
Operations and Supply Chain Management.

3
00:00:08.061 --> 00:00:10.131 line:88%
I have a 3.85 GPA,

4
00:00:10.151 --> 00:00:12.527 line:88%
and I've made the Dean's List every quarter.

5
00:00:12.797 --> 00:00:18.167 line:88%
In 2026, I worked at a trading company and
a printing company back home in Zhejiang,

6
00:00:18.187 --> 00:00:21.788 line:88%
and I kept running into the same problem:
information was scattered.

7
00:00:22.058 --> 00:00:25.788 line:88%
At Challenger Trading, one accurate quote
could take me over ten minutes,

8
00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:28.368 line:88%
because prices were split across old quotations,

9
00:00:28.388 --> 00:00:30.973 line:88%
our website, and Alibaba product pages.

10
00:00:31.243 --> 00:00:34.338 line:88%
So I taught myself to build an AI knowledge assistant.

11
00:00:34.308 --> 00:00:36.407 line:88%
At first, its answers were often wrong.

12
00:00:36.377 --> 00:00:38.267 line:88%
After testing different search methods,

13
00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:42.643 line:88%
the right source showed up in its
top three results 84% of the time.

14
00:00:42.613 --> 00:00:45.123 line:88%
And when it isn't sure, it says so and shows the source,

15
00:00:45.143 --> 00:00:46.769 line:88%
instead of guessing a price.

16
00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:50.089 line:88%
I also wanted to practice on real supply chain data,

17
00:00:50.109 --> 00:00:54.299 line:88%
so I analyzed 4.85 million public retail records.

18
00:00:54.269 --> 00:00:56.679 line:88%
Stockouts showed up in 44% of them,

19
00:00:56.699 --> 00:00:59.539 line:88%
and a simple forecast beat my more complex approach,

20
00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.221 line:88%
so I kept the simple one.

21
00:01:01.491 --> 00:01:03.072 line:88%
I build with AI tools.

22
00:01:03.042 --> 00:01:04.792 line:88%
My part is choosing the right question,

23
00:01:04.812 --> 00:01:08.245 line:88%
checking the numbers, and explaining
what they mean for the business.

24
00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:11.051 line:88%
I'm Haoqi Luo. Thanks for watching.
